⚡ Loaded System Core Utilities (./Init)
  Connect-Azure
 (azl)
    Authenticates to Azure for the Planet Pearce tenant and sets the active subscription using Connect-AzAccount.
  Enable-VS
 (vst)
    Mounts the Visual Studio Developer Shell environment into the current terminal session via vswhere without resetting the working directory.
  Get-Commands
 (cmds)
    Lists all loaded Init utilities and available Scripts with their aliases and descriptions. Use -Library for an expanded view.
  Get-DevCacheStatus

    Reports current disk usage for high-traffic Dev Drive cache paths including NuGet packages, MSBuild outputs, Roslyn compiles, and ReSharper caches.
  Get-DevDriveStatus

    Validates D: Dev Drive health by checking ReFS format, async antivirus filter mode, and trusted state.
  Get-GitLogTable
 (glt)
    Outputs the last 20 git commits as a tab-aligned table showing hash, author, date, and commit subject.
  Get-Go
 (go)
    Smart navigation hub for jumping to bookmarked directories, git repositories, and web URLs. Accepts an optional fuzzy filter argument.
  Get-Listing
 (ll)
    Linux-style listing helpers: ll (long), la (show hidden), lr (recursive), lss (sort by size), ldu (dir sizes).
  Get-PlanetPearceMenu
 (pp)
    Displays an interactive fuzzy command radar menu listing all available Init utilities and Scripts for quick discovery and execution.
  Get-Status
 (status)
    Shows the current status of the development environment, including Dev Drive health, cache telemetry, global.json detection, and installed SDKs.
  Open-MarkdownBrowser
 (mdview)
    Renders a Markdown file with custom CSS styling in the default browser. Defaults to README.md in the current directory.
  Set-Project
 (vsp)
    Discovers .sln and .slnx solution files in the directory tree, presents an interactive selection menu, and opens the chosen solution in Visual Studio.
  Update-TSGlobals

    Recursively walks JavaScript module directories, parses structural variables and function signatures, and generates a strongly-typed globals.d.ts declaration file for IntelliSense.

⚡ Initialized Scripts (./Scripts)
  Clean-Build

    Safely deletes bin, obj, and .vs build artifacts under verified project footprints. Supports -Deep flag to also flush the local NuGet package cache.
  NugetAnalysis

    Scans all .csproj files in the current solution directory and opens a NuGet package inventory grid view showing installed versions and any version conflicts.
  Update-TSGlobals

    Build tool entry point for Update-TSGlobals. Loads the profile and forwards arguments — call with pwsh -File instead of powershell -Command.
  Update-Version

    Stamps the current git commit hash into the InformationalVersion field of the nearest .csproj file, auto-detecting the project if no path is supplied.

